 "text": "\t\t\t\t\t<li>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 515, "text": "\t\t\t\t\t\t上記の割引率は一例であり、ブランド（商品）ごとに基本特典の最大適用率および<br>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 516, "text": "\t\t\t\t\t\t会員ランクによる割引率は異なります。", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 517, "text": "\t\t\t\t\t</li>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 518, "text": "\t\t\t\t\t<li>会員価格は追加割引（提携クーポン・基本特典・決済クーポン）の適用前の価格です。</li>", "spans": []}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 519, "text": "\t\t\t\t\t<li>ランクアップ申請完了後、再ログインいただくとランク特典が適用されます。</li>", "spans": []}, {"t": " ", "a": 519, "b": 520, "text": "\t\t\t\t</ul>"}, {"t": " ", "a": 520, "b": 521, "text": "\t\t\t</div>"}, {"t": " ", "a": 521, "b": 522, "text": "\t\t\t<div class=\"_code_inp\">"}, {"t": " ", "a": 522, "b": 523, "text": "\t\t\t\t<div class=\"_area_wrap\">"}, {"t": "-", "a": 523, "b": null, "text": "\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"text\" data-algnnum=\"Y\" class=\"_pre_input\" name=\"cooperationEvt\" id=\"cooperationEvt\" maxlength=\"\" value=\"\" placeholder=\"请输入优惠券码\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase;\" />", "spans": [[137, 139], [140, 144]]}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 524, "text": "\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"text\" data-algnnum=\"Y\" class=\"_pre_input\" name=\"cooperationEvt\" id=\"cooperationEvt\" maxlength=\"\" value=\"\" placeholder=\"クーポン番号を入力してください。\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase;\" />", "spans": [[137, 144], [145, 153]]}, {"t": " ", "a": 524, "b": 525, "text": "\t\t\t\t</div>"}, {"t": " ", "a": 525, "b": 526, "text": "\t\t\t</div>"}, {"t": " ", "a": 526, "b": 527, "text": "\t\t\t<div class=\"_btn_set _submit_btn\">"}, {"t": " ", "a": 527, "b": 528, "text": "\t\t\t\t<div class=\"_area_wrap\">"}, {"t": " ", "a": 528, "b": 529, "text": "\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\" class=\"_ev_fn_submit\">"}, {"t": "-", "a": 529, "b": null, "text": "\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"_name\">领取优惠</span>", "spans": [[26, 30]]}, {"t": "+", "a": null, "b": 530, "text": "\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"_name\">すべてダウンロード</span>", "spans": [[26, 35]]}, {"t": " ", "a": 5